Parity unit : page:admin/ApiLogs   kind=page   web route=/api-logs
Web source  : web/src/features/admin/pages/ApiLogsPage.tsx
ADR refs    : ADR-002, ADR-004, ADR-005, ADR-006, ADR-011, ADR-013, ADR-014, ADR-015
Runner      : .NET 10.0.300 SDK present (dotnet --version 10.0.300) — NOT blocked.

=== APPROACH ===
- The repository's WinUI app is code-first C# (no .xaml page files); every feature surface lives under
  apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/<Name>/ as <Name>.Model.cs (pure, Microsoft.UI-free projection,
  unit-tested headlessly), <Name>.ViewModel.cs (INotifyPropertyChanged + IDisposable state holder, the
  established testable observable-view-model pattern — see AcDcStatsViewModel) and <Name>.cs (the Fluent view).
  The generated prompt's idealized "ApiLogsPage.xaml + ViewModel.cs under TeslaSync/Features/Admin" is mapped onto
  these real conventions; the surface registers itself with the W4 ShellPageFactory by route name ("ApiLogs").
- Manifest models this unit as rendering from navigation/local state ("no API data sources"): the generated C#
  client (ADR-004) exposes no /api-logs endpoint, so the view-model reads pages through an injected IApiLogsFeed
  (default EmptyApiLogsFeed resolves the empty state) rather than a fabricated client call. SI units N/A (no
  unit-bearing fields on this admin surface); display formatting still flows through the shared NumberFormatting /
  DateTimeFormatting ports (web fmtInt/fmtNumber + <DateTime>).
- All 30 i18n keys already exist verbatim in Strings/en/Resources.resw (translation.apiLogs.* + translation.error.loadFailed);
  the surface resolves them through the ILocalizer facade with the web key names (no new catalog rows required).
- Pre-existing blocker repaired: TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj had been corrupted by its documented .gitattributes
  merge=union strategy into two <Project> roots + duplicated <ItemGroup>/Compile items (MSB4025), which broke the
  whole-solution load. Regenerated it into the single canonical Project root the file's own INVARIANT comment
  mandates: case-insensitive ordinal path-sorted, Include-deduplicated union of every Microsoft.UI-free source
  (1312 distinct) plus the two new ApiLogsPage links (1314 total). No linked source dropped.

